{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07880","headline":"赠萧少府 · 孟浩然","name":"赠萧少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上德如流水，安仁道若山。\n闻君秉高节，而得奉清颜。\n鸿渐昇仪羽，牛刀列下班。\n处腴能不润，居剧体常闲。\n去诈人无谄，除邪吏息奸。\n欲知清与洁，明月照澄湾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}